<title>MOLDOVA: MOLDOVA 28-, 182-DAY T-BILLS DOWN, 91-DAY UP.</title>
<headline>MOLDOVA 28-, 182-DAY T-BILLS DOWN, 91-DAY UP.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The annualised yield on</p>
<p>Moldovan 28-day Treasury bills fell to 18.51 percent on Tuesday</p>
<p>from 19.85 percent on June 17, the National Bank said.</p>
<p>The yield on 91-day T-bills raised to 18.90 percent from</p>
<p>18.02 percent on June 17. The yield on 182-day T-bills fell to</p>
<p>19.11 percent from  19.35 percent on June 3.</p>
<p>Full details of the 28-day T-bill auction:</p>
<p>				    June 24	    June 17</p>
<p> Issue volume		   2.00 mln lei     2.00 mln lei</p>
<p> Denominations		  1,000 lei	  1,000 lei</p>
<p> Nominal demand		 4.56 mln	   3.01 mln</p>
<p> Volume sold		    2.00 mln	   2.00 mln</p>
<p> Yield			    18.51 pct	  19.85 pct</p>
<p> Price			    98.6 pct	   98.5 pct</p>
<p> Range of bids		  98.6-99.2 pct    98.5-99.2 pct</p>
<p> Maturity			 July 24, 1997    July 17, 1997</p>
<p>Full details of the three-month T-bill auction:</p>
<p>				    June 24	    June 17</p>
<p> Issue volume		   18.00 mln	  13.00 mln</p>
<p> Denominations		  1,000 lei	  1,000 lei</p>
<p> Nominal demand		 19.34 mln	  19.36 mln</p>
<p> Volume sold		    17.7 mln	   13.00 mln</p>
<p> Yield			    18.90 pct	  18.02 pct</p>
<p> Price			    95.5 pct	   95.7 pct</p>
<p> Range of bids		  95.5-96.7 pct    95.7-96.6 pct</p>
<p> Maturity			 Sep 25, 1997     Sep 18, 1997</p>
<p>Full details of the 182-days paper auction:</p>
<p>				    June 24	    June 3</p>
<p> Issue volume		   3.00 mln lei     7.00 mln lei</p>
<p> Denominations		  1,000 lei	  1,000 lei</p>
<p> Nominal demand		 3.79 mln	   28.92 mln</p>
<p> Volume sold		    3.00 mln	   7.00 mln</p>
<p> Yield			    19.11 pct	  19.35 pct</p>
<p> Price			    91.3 pct	   91.2 pct</p>
<p> Range of bids		  91.3-92.3 pct    91.2-91.7 pct</p>
<p> Maturity			 Dec 25, 1997     Dec 4, 1997</p>
